        "date": "2026-11-09T00:40:32Z"
      },
      "message": "fix(tools): an exported tool library always carries the .camtools suffix\n\nHands-on finding (macOS): the save panel suggests tools.camtools, but a\ntyped name without a suffix was written as is - macOS does not enforce\nan unknown extension - so the library landed with no suffix. Export now\nappends .camtools when the chosen name has no extension; a name that\nalready has one (.camtools, or a deliberate .json) is kept as typed.\n\nPinned by tool_library::an_export_name_without_a_suffix_gets_the_library_extension.\n\nRefs #300\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
